  "solution": {
    "text": "By L-hospital rule,<br />&nbsp;<math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Again by L-hospital rule,<br />&nbsp;<math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>"
